%T A123440 6498535,21529709
%N A123440 Number of P_4-reducible perfect graphs on n nodes.
%C A123440 A graph is P_4-reducible if no vertex belongs to more than one induced P_4 (path on 4 vertices). Every P_4-reducible graph is perfect, and the class is closed under induced subgraphs. - _Meghanto Majumder_, Oct 07 2026
